 Q("The gold, silver and orange shots have xG of 0.45, 0.07 and 0.03. What is the total?","0.55",["0.45","0.10","1.55"],"0.45 + 0.07 + 0.03 = 0.55. Roughly half a goal.",img=I("quiz-shots.jpg","The same three shots")),
