 Q("Look at the press. Why are the red players standing in the passing lanes instead of just chasing the ball?","To trap the ball-carrier — no easy pass means an error",["To block the referee's view","Because they are tired","To defend a corner"],"A press works as a group: one presses the ball, the others cut the lanes.",img=I("press.jpg","Red players cutting off passing lanes around a blue defender with the ball")),
