 Q("A defender desperately blocks a shot and the ball bounces to an attacker who was in an offside position when the shot was taken. Decision?","Still offside — a block/deflection is not 'deliberate play'",["Onside — the defender touched it","No offence because there was a shot","Retake the shot"],"Only a deliberate play (like a controlled pass or clearance) resets offside. A block does not."),
 Q("Team A: 70% possession, 0.4 xG. Team B: 30% possession, 1.6 xG. Which statement is best supported?","Team B created much better chances",["Team A played much better","The match must have ended 0-0","Possession and xG measure the same thing"],"xG measures chance quality. B had the better chances with less of the ball."),
